  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Drain sweetcorn. Finely chop tomato.\n• In a small bowl, combine corn and tomato. Add a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste and toss.\n• Roughly chop red onion. Roughly chop baby spinach. Drain and rinse black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/633ef8e10ab36729c30eccb8/step-dbbb6595.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice mini flour tortillas into wedges and place on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle or spray generously with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Bake until lightly golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/633ef8e10ab36729c30eccb8/step-cb5e6140.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion until just softened, 2-3 mins. Add beans and cook, stirring, until softened, 3-4 mins.\n• Stir in tomato paste and spicy taco seasoning (add less if you're sensitive to heat) and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in the water, vegetable stock powder, butter and spinach and simmer until wilted, 1-2 mins. Lightly mash beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/633ef8e10ab36729c30eccb8/step-ebcb6938.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tortilla chips between plates.\n• Top with black bean mixture, cheese and sour cream. Serve with corn salsa.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/633ef8e10ab36729c30eccb8/step-b9532db9.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
